<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of South American Libertadores Cup matches played this week:</p>
<p>Second round, first leg:</p>
<p>Played Tuesday:</p>
<p>In Santiago:</p>
<p>Universidad Catolica (Chile) 4 Oriente Petrolero (Bolivia) 0. Second leg to be played May 14.</p>
<p>Played Wednesday:</p>
<p>In Quito:</p>
<p>Nacional (Ecuador) 1 Cruzeiro (Brazil) 0. Second leg - May 14.</p>
<p>In Montevideo:</p>
<p>Nacional (Uruguay) 1 Colo Colo (Chile) 3. Second leg May 14.</p>
<p>Second round, second legs:</p>
<p>Played Tuesday:</p>
<p>In Porto Alegre, Brazil: Gremio (Brazil) 2 Guarany (Paraguay) 1.</p>
<p>Aggregate score 3-3. Gremio won 2-1 on penalties.</p>
<p>In Montevideo:</p>
<p>Penarol (Uruguay) 3 Millonarios (Colombia) 1. Aggregate 3-3. Penarol won 3-2 on penalties.</p>
<p>Played Wednesday</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: River Plate (Argentina) 1 Racing Club (Argentina) 1.</p>
<p>Aggregate 4-4. Racing Club won 5-3 on penalties.</p>
<p>In La Paz:</p>
<p>Bolivar (Bolivia) 7 Minerven (Venezuela) 0.</p>
<p>Bolivar won 8-1.</p>
<p>Played Thursday</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: Velez Sarsfield (Argentina) 0 Sporting Cristal (Peru) 1. Sporting Cristal won 1-0.</p>
</text>
